        <mxCell id="C80_Rczyluoj-wPILBfV-75" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;We Want to make the AI only respnsible for Advice , not Calculations , We will Derive Some Metrics that the AI will Rely On to Make His Advice , so the Advice will be based on the derived values , not the Raw values provided by the user&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" parent="1" vertex="1">
